                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg height=\"136\" width=\"584\"><text fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\">cost = reference_bw/int_bw\n\ndefault reference_bw = 100 000 Kbps\n\nInterface\t\t\tDefault Bandwith\t\tCOST\nSerial\t\t\t1544 Kbps\t\t\t\t64\nEthernet\t\t\t10 000 Kbps\t\t\t\t10\nFastEthernet\t\t100 000 Kbps\t\t\t1</text></svg>",
