                "y": 149,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "f85d341f-406f-44e7-a32b-ce23cdd56079",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"865\" height=\"200\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">\t- LSA1\t- generuje kazdy router, zahrna jeho priamo pripojene linky\n\t\t\t- sh ip ospf database router\n\t- LSA2\t- generuje designated router (DR) na multiaccess segmente, opisuje routre pripojene do daneho segmentu\n\t\t\t- sh ip ospf database network\n\t- LSA3\t- generuje ABR, zahrna siete z inej arey\n\t\t\t- sh ip ospf database summary\n\t- LSA4\t- generuje ABR, opisuje kde sa nachadza ASBR\n\t\t\t- sh ip ospf database asbr-summary\n\t- LSA5\t- generuje ASBR, zahrna externe routy redistribuovane do OSPF\n\t\t\t- sh ip ospf database external\n\t- LSA7\t- generuje ASBR ak sa nachadza v not-so-stubby (NSSA) arey\n\t\t\t- po prechode do arey 0 cez ABR nastava preklad LSA7 &gt; LSA5</text></svg>",
                "x": -743,
                "y": 213,
                "z": 2
            },
            {
                "drawing_id": "46badebe-7c86-4fb1-943e-c7f9c20b4e8d",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"222\" height=\"120\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">Type 1 LSA - ROUTER LSA - vy\nType 2 LSA - Network LSA - v\nType 3 LSA - Summary LSA - p\nType 5 LSA - AS External LSA\nType 4 LSA - Summary ASBR LSA\nType 7 LSA - NSSA LSA - posi\n</text></svg>",
                "x": -932,
                "y": 236,
                "z": 2
            },
